Objective 1: Baseline ARP Table
Command:   ip neigh show
           arp -n

Objective 2: Neighbor Table Inspection
Command:   ip neigh show dev eth0
           ip -s neigh show dev eth0

Objective 3: Detect Duplicate Gateway Mapping- Observe changes in gateway address mappings
Command:  ip neigh show 192.168.1.1         //First check the gateway mapping
          ping -c 3 192.168.1.1             //refresh the ARP entry
          ip neigh show 192.168.1.1         //check it again

Objective 4: Promiscuous Mode Check- Determine whether eth0 is in promiscous mode
Command:  ip link show eth0    //Check for PROMISC
      // If PROMISC appears, promiscuous mode is enabled.
      ip -details link show eth0
